  "prefLabel": "Rko 203.02 Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 203.02 Payments.\n\n(a) Payment of the fee established in RSA 91-A:7-b, I shall be in the form of:\n\n(1) A check or money order payable to “Treasurer, State of New Hampshire;” or\n\n(2) Cash, in the exact amount of the fee.\n\n(b) If, after the effective date of these rules, the ombudsman establishes within the office a system for the secure receipt of electronic payments and the verifiable electronic submission of complaints and attachments, payment of the fee established by RSA 91-A: 7-b I, and submission of complaints and attachments may be made by use of that system.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko100-200.html"
